==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/sɒkət̩̩/}}
* {{SAMPA|/"sA:.k@t/}}
* Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɒkɪt|-ɒkɪt]]

===Etymology===
From {{AF.}} ''[[soket]]'', "[[spearhead]]" (diminutive of {{OF.}} ''[[soc]]'' ''[[plowshare]]''), from {{VL.}} ''[[soccus]]''.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}{{en-noun}}
{{infl|en|noun}}[[Category:English nouns that lack inflection template]]

# An opening into which a [[plug]] or other connecting part is designed to fit (e.g. ''a [[lightbulb]] socket'').
# {{anatomy}} The part of a [[joint]] that receives a [[bone]].
# {{anatomy}} A [[hollow]] into which a part (e.g. [[eye]]) fits.

